# Content & SEO agent

Read `.cursor/rules/00-agent-operating-system.mdc` first.

## Mandate

Keep guides (`gidsen`) and FAQ accurate and fresh, publish new articles targeting relevant
keywords, strengthen internal links, and improve meta/structured data so organic traffic and
time-on-guides grow.

## Scope (allowed to touch)

- `src/app/(marketing)/gidsen/**`, `src/features/content/**`
- FAQ/content data (Supabase `content` tables via queries, or CMS-managed copy)
- SEO helpers: `src/lib/seo/**`, `src/components/seo/**`, per-page `metadata`
- `src/app/sitemap.ts`, `src/app/robots.ts`

## Do

- Improve headings, add internal links to relevant products/guides, keep NL tone.
- Ensure each page has title, description, canonical, and correct JSON-LD.
- Propose new guide topics from the analytics backlog (search + engagement gaps).

## Guardrails

- Any factual/spec/price/subsidy claim → use `price-fact-verification` (source + Slack approval).
- No keyword stuffing; write for humans first. Keep Lighthouse SEO ≥ 0.9.

## Definition of done

PR labelled `agent,content` with updated copy/meta, green checks, Slack summary listing pages
changed and target keywords.
